e.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x21s3p5wPww534nYj1cWakTcqz4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ShDHEWiJ4NL6ldn4W2m3bEkIBr.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Slevin is mistakenly put in the middle of a personal war between the city’s biggest criminal bosses. Under constant watch, Slevin must try not to get killed by an infamous assassin and come up with an idea of how to get out of his current dilemma.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446021,\"title\":\"Bad Times at the El Royale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qExufIc4Rw0e4xdVZlhMdmEDGES.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gb3TVVZNNxVGNfS1NxGaiWZfwnW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lake Tahoe, 1969. Seven strangers, each one with a secret to bury, meet at El Royale, a decadent motel with a dark past. In the course of a fateful night, everyone will have one last shot at redemption.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15472,\"title\":\"The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r2pFUXKK20KD9RE3yybpQsNynRE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dPE25PbaeE6fCR2SQb4H4MeBmml.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Swedish thriller based on Stieg Larsson's novel about a male journalist and a young female hacker. In the opening of the movie, Mikael Blomkvist, a middle-aged publisher for the magazine Millennium, loses a libel case brought by corrupt Swedish industrialist Hans-Erik Wennerström. Nevertheless, he is hired by Henrik Vanger in order to solve a cold case, the disappearance of Vanger's niece\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":169917,\"title\":\"A Walk Among the Tombstones\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/euPgyPsiNFp6gOBB7nUFxvN5ZaY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k23FPWl97XKpJ1oTaDyADzxWxs6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Private investigator Matthew Scudder is hired by a drug kingpin to find out who kidnapped and murdered his wife.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":866463,\"title\":\"Reptile\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/soIgqZBoTiTgMqUW0JtxsPWAilQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nrp2khEM6JWFqqNLeub1J6Qafe0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the brutal murder of a young real estate agent, a hardened detective attempts to uncover the truth in a case where nothing is as it seems, and by doing so dismantles the illusions in his own life.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":799876,\"title\":\"The Outfit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lZa5EB6PVJBT5mxhgZS5ftqdAm6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jjXnYpRQMqzylAmYqKL7VFa3l9w.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Leonard is an English tailor who used to craft suits on London’s world-famous Savile Row. After a personal tragedy, he’s ended up in Chicago, operating a small tailor shop in a rough part of town where he makes beautiful clothes for the only people around who can afford them: a family of vicious gangsters.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":24253,\"title\":\"The Girl Who Played with Fire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A8UjhPjINIBgmoH37aqt40u53PQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nra78PoXu2lQhdgFKJ8y8zL7HGN.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mikael Blomkvist, publisher of Millennium magazine, has made his living exposing the crooked and corrupt practices of establishment Swedish figures. So when a young journalist approaches him with a meticulously researched thesis about sex traffickin